                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you regarding your patient, a 54-year-old female admitted on 11th January 2021 with confirmed SARS-CoV-2 infection. On admission, the patient presented with fever, dry cough, and progressive dyspnoea. Chest X-ray and CT thorax confirmed bilateral COVID-19 pneumonia. Nasopharyngeal PCR swab was positive for SARS-CoV-2. Oxygen saturation on admission was 88% on room air. The patient received supplemental oxygen therapy via nasal cannula, dexamethasone, and prophylactic low-molecular-weight heparin. Remdesivir was administered for five days. Antibiotic therapy was added to cover potential secondary bacterial pneumonia. The patient showed gradual clinical improvement with oxygen requirements reducing progressively. She was discharged on 20th January 2021 in a recovering condition. Please ensure follow-up chest imaging in six weeks and continued monitoring of respiratory function. Do not hesitate to contact me for further information.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
